      "chunk_text": "Vihaan Patel confirmed he made the premium payment and asked Ravi Menon to confirm his policy is active. He also expressed frustration about not receiving an expiration notification. Ravi apologized, explained a technical glitch caused the missed alert, confirmed the payment was processed, but noted the policy still appears as 'Expired' in the system and will escalate the issue to the admin team to update the status.",
